  "Question": "\\(\\triangle ABC\\sim\\triangle DEF\\), and their areas are \\(9\\text{ cm}^2\\) and \\(25\\text{ cm}^2\\), respectively. The altitude to a side of \\(\\triangle ABC\\) is \\(6\\text{ cm}\\). Find the altitude to the corresponding side of \\(\\triangle DEF\\). (Unit: cm)",
