  "Correct Answer": "10",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The area ratio is \\(9:25\\), so the similarity ratio is \\(3:5\\). The ratio of corresponding altitudes equals the similarity ratio: \\(6/h=3/5\\), giving \\(h=10\\).",
